 style="max-height:100%;max-width:100%" border="0" width="44" height="47" alt="sum_(n=1)^(infty)1/(p_n^s)" /></td><td
 align="right" width="10">
<div id="eqn1" class="eqnum">
(1)
</div>
</td></tr><tr style=""><td align="right" width=""><img src="/images/equations/PrimeNumber/Inline25.svg" class="displayformula" style="max-height:100%;max-width:100%" border="0" width="12"
